      "verbatim_snippet": "#define skinny128_sbox(x) \\\ndo { \\\n    uint32_t y; \\\n    \\\n    /* Mix the bits */ \\\n    x = ~x; \\\n    x ^= (((x >> 2) & (x >> 3)) & 0x11111111U); \\\n    y  = (((x << 5) & (x << 1)) & 0x20202020U); \\\n    x ^= (((x << 5) & (x << 4)) & 0x40404040U) ^ y; \\\n    y  = (((x << 2) & (x << 1)) & 0x80808080U); \\\n    x ^= (((x >> 2) & (x << 1)) & 0x02020202U) ^ y; \\\n    y  = (((x >> 5) & (x << 1)) & 0x04040404U); \\\n    x ^= (((x >> 1) & (x >> 2)) & 0x08080808U) ^ y; \\\n    x = ~x; \\\n    \\\n    /* Permutation generated by http://programming.sirrida.de/calcperm.php */ \\\n    /* The final permutation for each byte is [2 7 6 1 3 0 4 5] */ \\\n    x = ((x & 0x08080808U) << 1) | \\\n        ((x & 0x32323232U) << 2) | \\\n        ((x & 0x01010101U) << 5) | \\\n        ((x & 0x80808080U) >> 6) | \\\n        ((x & 0x40404040U) >> 4) | \\\n        ((x & 0x04040404U) >> 2); \\\n} while (0)"
